# ── Fallback profile: baseten ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Selected by FALLBACK_PROFILE=baseten. Where a call goes while the ACTIVE provider (LLM_PROFILE) is
# refusing on capacity (HTTP 429 / 503), for 120 s at a time. Ids are Baseten catalogue slugs and are
# CASE-SENSITIVE; a wrong one silently falls through to the next model.
#
# Ships with a dummy key: enter the real one on the dashboard's Stack Settings page.
FALLBACK_LLM_PROVIDER=baseten
FALLBACK_LLM_API_KEY=replace-me-in-stack-settings
FALLBACK_SMART_MODELS=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731,deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
# The MCP summary tier (query enrichment) reads FALLBACK_SMARTER_MODELS — ONE id, as in the LLM profiles.
FALLBACK_SMARTER_MODELS=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731
FALLBACK_SMARTEST_MODELS=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro
